":"BBS The FoldCAS","es":"BBS es un sistema de seguimiento de problemas CAS-nativo que permite crear y rastrear problemas, encontrar trabajo disponible y gestionar dependencias","fr":"BBS est un système de suivi de problèmes CAS-natif qui permet de créer et de suivre des problèmes, de trouver du travail disponible et de gérer des dépendances","de":"BBS ist ein CAS-natives Issue-Tracking-System, das die Erstellung und Nachverfolgung von Problemen, die Suche nach verfügbaren Arbeiten und die Verwaltung vo...","pt":"O BBS é um sistema de gerenciamento de problemas baseado em block primitives que permite criar e rastrear problemas de forma eficaz.","ru":"BBS - это система управления проблемами на основе блоков, которая позволяет создавать и отслеживать проблемы эффективно.","ar":"نظام إدارة المشكلات BBS هو نظام مبني على الكتل يسمح بإنشاء وتتبع المشكلات بفعالية.","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["CAS","Block","","",""],"ja":["CAS","Block","","",""],"ko":["CAS","Block","","",""],"es":["Creación y seguimiento de problemas","Búsqueda de trabajo disponible","Gestión de dependencias entre problemas","Revisión del historial y estado de los problemas","Integración con block primitives"],"fr":["Création et suivi de problèmes","Recherche de travail disponible","Gestion de dépendances entre problèmes","Révision de l''historique et de l''état des problèmes","Intégration avec block primitives"],"de":["Erstellung und Nachverfolgung von Problemen","Suche nach verfügbaren Arbeiten","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten zwischen Problemen","Überprüfung des Historie und Status von Problemen","Integration mit Block-Primitiven"],"pt":["Criação e rastreamento de problemas","Gerenciamento de dependências entre problemas","Revisão do histórico e status dos problemas","Listagem de problemas disponíveis","Gerenciamento de tarefas e recursos"],"ru":["Создание и отслеживание проблем","Управление зависимостями между проблемами","Просмотр истории и статуса проблем","Список доступных проблем","Управление задачами и ресурсами"],"ar":["إنشاء وتتبع المشكلات","إدارة зависимости المشكلات","استعراض تاريخ وحالة المشكلات","قائمة المشكلات المتاحة","إدارة المهام والموارد"]},"keywords":{"zh":["BBS","CAS","Block","","The Fold","Issue Tracker"],"ja":["BBS","CAS","Block","","The Fold","Issue Tracker"],"ko":["BBS","CAS","Block","","The Fold","Issue Tracker"],"es":["BBS","sistema de seguimiento de problemas","CAS-nativo","The Fold","desarrollo de software","gestión de proyectos","issue tracking","block primitives"],"fr":["BBS","système de suivi de problèmes","CAS-natif","The Fold","développement de logiciels","gestion de projets","issue tracking","block primitives"],"de":["BBS","Issue-Tracking-System","CAS-nativ","The Fold","Software-Entwicklung","Projektverwaltung","Issue-Tracking","Block-Primitiven"],"pt":["bbs","sistema de gerenciamento de problemas","block primitives","gerenciamento de problemas","rastreamento de problemas","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["bbs","система управления проблемами","блоки","управление проблемами","отслеживание проблем","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["نظام إدارة المشكلات","بباس","الكتل","إدارة المشكلات","تتبع المشكلات","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bbs","description":"Manage issues with The Folds CAS-native BBS (Bulletin Board System). Use for creating, updating, searching, and tracking issues. Invoke when the user wants to create tickets, find work, check issue status, or manage dependencies.","bodyPreview":"# BBS (Bulletin Board System) Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nBBS is The Fold''s CAS-native issue tracker built on block primitives. All issues are content-addressed, with full history preserved in the store.\n\nUse BBS for:\n- Creating and tracking issues (bugs, features, tasks, epics)\n- Finding available work (unblocked issues)\n- Managing dependencies between issues\n- Reviewing issue history and status\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Purpose | Example |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `bbs-list` | List iss","body":"# BBS (Bulletin Board System) Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nBBS is The Fold''s CAS-native issue tracker built on block primitives. All issues are content-addressed, with full history preserved in the store.\n\nUse BBS for:\n- Creating and tracking issues (bugs, features, tasks, epics)\n- Finding available work (unblocked issues)\n- Managing dependencies between issues\n- Reviewing issue history and status\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Command | Purpose | Example |\n|---------|---------|---------|\n| `bbs-list` | List issues | `(bbs-list)` |\n| `bbs-show` | View issue details | `(bbs-show ''fold-001)` |\n| `bbs-create` | Create new issue | `(bbs-create \"Title\")` |\n| `bbs-update` | Update issue fields | `(bbs-update ''fold-001 ''status ''in_progress)` |\n| `bbs-close` | Close an issue | `(bbs-close ''fold-001)` |\n| `bbs-find` | Search issue titles | `(bbs-find \"query\")` |\n| `bbs-search` | Search titles + descriptions | `(bbs-search \"query\")` |\n| `bbs-ready` | Show unblocked work | `(bbs-ready)` |\n| `bbs-blocked` | Show blocked issues | `(bbs-blocked)` |\n| `bbs-dep` | Add dependency | `(bbs-dep ''blocker ''blocked)` |\n| `bbs-add-blocker` | Add dependency (alias) | `(bbs-add-blocker ''fold-001 ''fold-002)` |\n| `bbs-list-by-label` | Filter by label | `(bbs-list-by-label ''topology)` |\n| `bbs-list-by-type` | Filter by type | `(bbs-list-by-type ''epic)` |\n| `bbs-label-report` | Show all labels | `(bbs-label-report)` |\n| `bbs-stats` | Database statistics | `(bbs-stats)` |\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Listing Issues\n\n```bash\n# List open issues (default)\n./fold \"(bbs-list)\"\n\n# List closed issues\n./fold \"(bbs-list ''status ''closed)\"\n\n# List all issues regardless of status\n./fold \"(bbs-list ''status ''all)\"\n```\n\n### Viewing Issues\n\n```bash\n# View issue details\n./fold \"(bbs-show ''fold-001)\"\n\n# Search issue titles\n./fold \"(bbs-find \\\"auth\\\")\"\n\n# Search titles AND descriptions (more comprehensive)\n./fold \"(bbs-search \\\"authentication\\\")\"\n\n# Show unblocked work (ready to start)\n./fold \"(bbs-ready)\"\n\n# Show blocked issues\n./fold \"(bbs-blocked)\"\n```\n\n### Filtering Issues\n\n```bash\n# Filter by label\n./fold \"(bbs-list-by-label ''topology)\"\n\n# Filter by type (task, bug, feature, epic)\n./fold \"(bbs-list-by-type ''epic)\"\n\n# Get programmatic list of IDs with label (not displayed)\n./fold \"(bbs-by-label ''refactor)\"\n\n# Show all labels in use\n./fold \"(bbs-label-report)\"\n```\n\n### Creating Issues\n\n```bash\n# Basic create (just title)\n./fold \"(bbs-create \\\"Fix authentication bug\\\")\"\n\n# With priority (0=critical, 2=medium, 4=backlog)\n./fold \"(bbs-create \\\"Urgent fix\\\" ''priority 0)\"\n\n# With type (task, bug, feature, epic)\n./fold \"(bbs-create \\\"Add dark mode\\\" ''type ''feature)\"\n\n# Full creation with all options\n./fold \"(bbs-create \\\"Refactor auth\\\" ''description \\\"Detailed description here\\\" ''priority 1 ''type ''task ''labels ''(core security))\"\n```\n\n### Updating Issues\n\n```bash\n# Update status\n./fold \"(bbs-update ''fold-001 ''status ''in_progress)\"\n\n# Change priority\n./fold \"(bbs-update ''fold-001 ''priority 0)\"\n\n# Add labels\n./fold \"(bbs-update ''fold-001 ''labels ''(urgent core))\"\n\n# Update description\n./fold \"(bbs-update ''fold-001 ''description \\\"New description\\\")\"\n```\n\n### Closing Issues\n\n```bash\n# Simple close\n./fold \"(bbs-close ''fold-001)\"\n\n# Close with reason\n./fold \"(bbs-close ''fold-001 ''reason \\\"Fixed in commit abc123\\\")\"\n```\n\n### Managing Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# fold-001 blocks fold-002 (fold-002 depends on fold-001)\n./fold \"(bbs-dep ''fold-001 ''fold-002)\"\n\n# What blocks this issue?\n./fold \"(bbs-blockers ''fold-002)\"\n\n# What does this issue block?\n./fold \"(bbs-blocking ''fold-001)\"\n\n# All unblocked open issues (ready for work)\n./fold \"(bbs-ready)\"\n```\n\n### History & Statistics\n\n```bash\n# Show version history for an issue\n./fold \"(bbs-history ''fold-001)\"\n\n# Database statistics\n./fold \"(bbs-stats)\"\n```\n\n## Field Reference\n\n### Priority Levels\n\n| Priority | Meaning |\n|----------|---------|\n| 0 | Critical - drop everything |\n| 1 | High - do soon |\n| 2 | Medium (default) |\n| 3 | Low - when time permits |\n| 4 | Backlog - someday maybe |\n\n### Issue Types\n\n| Type | Use For |\n|------|---------|\n| `task` | General work items |\n| `bug` | Defects to fix |\n| `feature` | New functionality |\n| `epic` | Large multi-issue efforts |\n\n### Status Values\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n|--------|---------|\n| `open` | Not yet started |\n| `in_progress` | Currently being worked |\n| `closed` | Completed or won''t fix |\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Typical Bug Fix Workflow\n\n```bash\n# Find the bug\n./fold \"(bbs-find \\\"auth\\\")\"\n\n# Check details\n./fold \"(bbs-show ''fold-042)\"\n\n# Start working on it\n./fold \"(bbs-update ''fold-042 ''status ''in_progress)\"\n\n# ... fix the bug ...\n\n# Close it\n./fold \"(bbs-close ''fold-042 ''reason \\\"Fixed token refresh logic\\\")\"\n```\n\n### Example 2: Creating a Feature with Dependencies\n\n```bash\n# Create the main feature\n./fold \"(bbs-create \\\"Add export functionality\\\" ''type ''feature ''priority 1)\"\n# Returns: fold-100\n\n# Create sub-tasks\n./fold \"(bbs-create \\\"Design export API\\\" ''type ''task)\"\n# Returns: fold-101\n\n./fold \"(bbs-create \\\"Implement CSV export\\\" ''type ''task)\"\n# Returns: fold-102\n\n# Set up dependencies (design must complete before implementation)\n./fold \"(bbs-dep ''fold-101 ''fold-102)\"\n\n# Main feature blocked by implementation\n./fold \"(bbs-dep ''fold-102 ''fold-100)\"\n```\n\n### Example 3: Finding Available Work\n\n```bash\n# What''s ready to work on?\n./fold \"(bbs-ready)\"\n\n# Get stats overview\n./fold \"(bbs-stats)\"\n\n# See what''s currently blocked\n./fold \"(bbs-blocked)\"\n```\n\n### Example 4: Triaging Issues\n\n```bash\n# List all open issues\n./fold \"(bbs-list)\"\n\n# Bump priority on critical item\n./fold \"(bbs-update ''fold-050 ''priority 0)\"\n\n# Add labels for categorization\n./fold \"(bbs-update ''fold-050 ''labels ''(security urgent))\"\n```\n\n### Example 5: Finding Related Work by Label\n\n```bash\n# See what labels exist\n./fold \"(bbs-label-report)\"\n\n# Find all topology-related issues\n./fold \"(bbs-list-by-label ''topology)\"\n\n# Find all epics to see big-picture work\n./fold \"(bbs-list-by-type ''epic)\"\n\n# Deep search in descriptions\n./fold \"(bbs-search \\\"homology\\\")\"\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- **Issue IDs**: Can be symbols (`''fold-001`) or strings (`\"fold-001\"`)\n- **Auto-initialization**: BBS initializes automatically when the REPL starts\n- **CAS Storage**: All issues are content-addressed in `.store/`\n- **Head files**: Current issue state tracked in `.store/heads/bbs/`\n- **Counter**: Issue counter in `.bbs/counter`\n\n## Pipeline Integration\n\nBBS effects are available in agent pipelines (`lattice/pipeline/effects.ss`):\n\n```scheme\n(bbs-create \"title\")              ; Create issue, return ID\n(bbs-create-full title desc type priority)\n(bbs-update id updates-alist)     ; Update issue fields\n(bbs-close id)                    ; Close issue\n(bbs-ready)                       ; Get unblocked issues\n(bbs-show id)                     ; Get issue details\n```\n\n## File Locations\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `.store/heads/bbs/` | Issue head files (current hash per issue) |\n| `.bbs/counter` | Next issue number |\n| `.bbs/deps` | Dependency relationships |\n| `boundary/bbs/bbs.ss` | Core BBS implementation |\n| `boundary/bbs/ops.ss` | BBS operations |\n| `boundary/bbs/index.ss` | BBS indexing |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:57:26.278Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring robust issue tracking and management capabilities with content-addressed storage","zh":"适合需要强大的问题跟踪和管理功能的开发代理，采用内容寻址存储","ja":"開発エージェントが堅牢な問題追跡および管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。コンテンツアドレッシングストレージを使用しています","ko":"개발 에이전트가 강력한 문제 추적 및 관리 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다. 내용 주소 지정 저장소를 사용합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren capacidades robustas de seguimiento y gestión de problemas con almacenamiento con direcciones de contenido","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de suivi et de gestion de problèmes robustes avec un stockage à adressage de contenu","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungssagenten, die robuste Fähigkeiten zur Problemmeldung und -verwaltung mit inhaltsadressiertem Speicher benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem capacidades robustas de rastreamento e gerenciamento de problemas com armazenamento endereçado por conteúdo","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, требующих надежных возможностей отслеживания и управления проблемами с хранилищем, адресуемым по содержимому","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين требуетون قدرات متقدمة لتتبع وإدارة المشاكل مع تخزين عن طريق المحتوى"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, track, and manage issues using block primitives, preserving full history in the store, and enables review of issue history and status using commands like `bbs-list`","zh":"赋予代理创建、跟踪和管理问题的能力，使用块原语，在存储中保留完整的历史记录，并允许使用命令（如 `bbs-list`）查看问题历史记录和状态","ja":"エージェントが問題を作成、追跡、管理できるようにし、ブロックプリミティブを使用してストアに完全な履歴を保持し、`bbs-list` のようなコマンドを使用して問題履歴と状態を確認できるようにします","ko":"에이전트가 문제를 생성, 추적 및 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 블록 원시를 사용하여 저장소에 전체 기록을 유지하고, `bbs-list`와 같은 명령을 사용하여 문제 기록 및 상태를 검토할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, seguir y gestionar problemas utilizando primitivas de bloque, preservando la historia completa en la tienda, y permite la revisión de la historia y el estado de los problemas utilizando comandos como `bbs-list`","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de suivre et de gérer des problèmes en utilisant des primitives de bloc, en préservant l''historique complet dans le magasin, et permet l''examen de l''historique et de l''état des problèmes en utilisant des commandes comme `bbs-list`","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Probleme zu erstellen, zu verfolgen und zu verwalten, indem Blockprimitiven verwendet werden, wodurch die vollständige Historie im Speicher erhalten bleibt, und ermöglicht die Überprüfung der Historie und des Status von Problemen mithilfe von Befehlen wie `bbs-list`","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, rastrear e gerenciar problemas usando primitivos de bloco, preservando a história completa no repositório, e permite a revisão da história e status do problema usando comandos como `bbs-list`","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, отслеживать и управлять проблемами, используя блок-примитивы, сохраняя полную историю в хранилище, и позволяет просматривать историю и статус проблемы, используя команды, такие как `bbs-list`","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء وتتبع وإدارة المشاكل باستخدام البريمتيفات الكتليبية، مع الحفاظ على السجل الكامل في المتجر، وتمكن من استعراض سجل حالة المشكلة باستخدام أوامر مثل `bbs-list`"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating and tracking bugs, features, and tasks","Managing dependencies between issues","Reviewing issue history and status"],"zh":["创建和跟踪错误、功能和任务","管理问题之间的依赖关系","查看问题历史记录和状态"],"ja":["バグ、機能、タスクの作成と追跡","問題間の依存関係の管理","問題履歴と状態の確認"],"ko":["버그, 기능, 작업 생성 및 추적","문제 간 의존성 관리","문제 기록 및 상태 검토"],"es":["Crear y seguir errores, características y tareas","Gestionar dependencias entre problemas","Revisar la historia y el estado de los problemas"],"fr":["Créer et suivre des bogues, des fonctionnalités et des tâches","Gérer les dépendances entre les problèmes","Examiner l''historique et l''état des problèmes"],"de":["Fehler, Funktionen und Aufgaben erstellen und verfolgen","Abhängigkeiten zwischen Problemen verwalten","Historie und Status von Problemen überprüfen"],"pt":["Criar e rastrear bugs, recursos e tarefas","Gerenciar dependências entre problemas","Revisar história e status do problema"],"ru":["Создание и отслеживание ошибок, функций и задач","Управление зависимостями между проблемами","Просмотр истории и статуса проблемы"],"ar":["إنشاء وتتبع العيوب والميزات والمهام","إدارة التبعيات بين المشاكل","استعراض سجل وحالة المشكلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to The Fold''s CAS-native issue tracker","Built on block primitives, may require specific backend infrastructure"],"zh":["需要访问The Fold的CAS本地问题跟踪器","建立在块原语上，可能需要特定的后端基础设施"],"ja":["The FoldのCASネイティブ問題トラッカーへのアクセスが必要","ブロックプリミティブ上に構築されているため、特定のバックエンドインフラストラクチャが必要になる場合があります"],"ko":["The Fold의 CAS 네이티브 문제 추적기에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","블록 원시 위에 구축되므로 특정 백엔드 인프라가 필요할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al rastreador de problemas nativo de CAS de The Fold","Construido sobre primitivas de bloque, puede requerir infraestructura de backend específica"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au suivi de problèmes natif de CAS de The Fold","Construit sur des primitives de bloc, peut nécessiter une infrastructure de backend spécifique"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf den CAS-nativen Problemmelder von The Fold","Basierend auf Blockprimitiven, kann spezifische Backend-Infrastruktur erforderlich sein"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao rastreador de problemas nativo do CAS da The Fold","Construído em primitivos de bloco, pode requerer infraestrutura de backend específica"],"ru":["Требует доступа к родному отслеживателю проблем CAS от The Fold","Построен на блок-примитивах, может требовать специфической инфраструктуры бэкенда"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى عارض المشاكل الأصلي ل CAS من The Fold"," مبني على البريمتيفات الكتليبية، وربما يتطلب بنية تحتية للخلفية محددة"]},"version":3},"contentH