andlung von UI-Generierungs-Ideen","Erstellung von optimierten Prompts für Stitch","Verbesserung der Effizienz bei der UI-Generierung","Kompatibilität mit den besten Praktiken von Stitch","Optimierung der UI-Generierungs-Ergebnisse"],"pt":["Otimização de prompts para Stitch","Melhoria dos resultados da geração de UI","Guia de boas práticas para prompts eficazes","Compatibilidade com a documentação oficial do Stitch","Transformação de ideias vagas em prompts polidos"],"ru":["Оптимизация промптов для Stitch","Улучшение результатов генерации UI","Руководство по лучшим практикам для эффективных промптов","Совместимость с официальной документацией Stitch","Преобразование расплывчатых идей в отполированные промпты"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبتات لستيتش","تحسين نتائج توليد واجهة المستخدم","دليل لأفضل الممارسات لبرومبتات فعالة","التوافق مع وثائق ستيتش الرسمية","تحويل الأفكار الغامضة إلى برومبتات منقحة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["增强提示","Stitch 提示工程师","UI 生成结果优化","最佳实践","指导","结果质量","技术","开发"],"ja":["Enhance Prompt","Stitch プロンプトエンジニア","UI 生成結果の最適化","ベストプラクティス","ガイド","結果の品質","テクニック","開発"],"ko":["강화 프롬프트","스티치 프롬프트 엔지니어","UI 생성 결과 최적화","모범 사례","지침","결과 품질","기술","개발"],"es":["mejora de prompt","Stitch","generación de UI","prompts optimizados","eficiencia en la generación de UI","mejores prácticas de Stitch"],"fr":["amélioration de prompt","Stitch","génération d''UI","prompts optimisés","efficacité dans la génération d''UI","meilleures pratiques de Stitch"],"de":["Prompt-Verbesserung","Stitch","UI-Generierung","optimierte Prompts","Effizienz bei der UI-Generierung","beste Praktiken von Stitch"],"pt":["otimização de prompts","stitch","geração de ui","prompts eficazes","boas práticas","documentação oficial"],"ru":["оптимизация промптов","stitch","генерация ui","эффективные промпты","лучшие практики","официальная документация"],"ar":["تحسين البرومبتات","ستيتش","توليد واجهة المستخدم","برومبتات فعالة","أفضل الممارسات","وثائق رسمية"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"enhance-prompt","description":"Transforms vague UI ideas into polished, Stitch-optimized prompts. Enhances specificity, adds UI/UX keywords, injects design system context, and structures output for better generation results.","bodyPreview":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the pat","body":"# Enhance Prompt for Stitch\n\nYou are a **Stitch Prompt Engineer**. Your job is to transform rough or vague UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts that produce better results from Stitch.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore enhancing prompts, consult the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices:\n\n- **Stitch Effective Prompting Guide**: https://stitch.withgoogle.com/docs/learn/prompting/\n\nThis guide contains up-to-date recommendations that may supersede or complement the patterns in this skill.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\nActivate when a user wants to:\n- Polish a UI prompt before sending to Stitch\n- Improve a prompt that produced poor results\n- Add design system consistency to a simple idea\n- Structure a vague concept into an actionable prompt\n\n## Enhancement Pipeline\n\nFollow these steps to enhance any prompt:\n\n### Step 1: Assess the Input\n\nEvaluate what''s missing from the user''s prompt:\n\n| Element | Check for | If missing... |\n|---------|-----------|---------------|\n| **Platform** | \"web\", \"mobile\", \"desktop\" | Add based on context or ask |\n| **Page type** | \"landing page\", \"dashboard\", \"form\" | Infer from description |\n| **Structure** | Numbered sections/components | Create logical page structure |\n| **Visual style** | Adjectives, mood, vibe | Add appropriate descriptors |\n| **Colors** | Specific values or roles | Add design system or suggest |\n| **Components** | UI-specific terms | Translate to proper keywords |\n\n### Step 2: Check for DESIGN.md\n\nLook for a `DESIGN.md` file in the current project:\n\n**If DESIGN.md exists:**\n1. Read the file to extract the design system block\n2. Include the color palette, typography, and component styles\n3. Format as a \"DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED)\" section in the output\n\n**If DESIGN.md does not exist:**\n1. Add this note at the end of the enhanced prompt:\n\n```\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill. This ensures all generated pages share the \nsame visual language.\n```\n\n### Step 3: Apply Enhancements\n\nTransform the input using these techniques:\n\n#### A. Add UI/UX Keywords\n\nReplace vague terms with specific component names:\n\n| Vague | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"menu at the top\" | \"navigation bar with logo and menu items\" |\n| \"button\" | \"primary call-to-action button\" |\n| \"list of items\" | \"card grid layout\" or \"vertical list with thumbnails\" |\n| \"form\" | \"form with labeled input fields and submit button\" |\n| \"picture area\" | \"hero section with full-width image\" |\n\n#### B. Amplify the Vibe\n\nAdd descriptive adjectives to set the mood:\n\n| Basic | Enhanced |\n|-------|----------|\n| \"modern\" | \"clean, minimal, with generous whitespace\" |\n| \"professional\" | \"sophisticated, trustworthy, with subtle shadows\" |\n| \"fun\" | \"vibrant, playful, with rounded corners and bold colors\" |\n| \"dark mode\" | \"dark theme with high-contrast accents on deep backgrounds\" |\n\n#### C. Structure the Page\n\nOrganize content into numbered sections:\n\n```markdown\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Navigation with logo and menu items\n2. **Hero Section:** Headline, subtext, and primary CTA\n3. **Content Area:** [Describe the main content]\n4. **Footer:** Links, social icons, copyright\n```\n\n#### D. Format Colors Properly\n\nWhen colors are mentioned, format them as:\n```\nDescriptive Name (#hexcode) for functional role\n```\n\nExamples:\n- \"Deep Ocean Blue (#1a365d) for primary buttons and links\"\n- \"Warm Cream (#faf5f0) for page background\"\n- \"Soft Gray (#6b7280) for secondary text\"\n\n### Step 4: Format the Output\n\nStructure the enhanced prompt in this order:\n\n```markdown\n[One-line description of the page purpose and vibe]\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: [Web/Mobile], [Desktop/Mobile]-first\n- Theme: [Light/Dark], [style descriptors]\n- Background: [Color description] (#hex)\n- Primary Accent: [Color description] (#hex) for [role]\n- Text Primary: [Color description] (#hex)\n- [Additional design tokens...]\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **[Section]:** [Description]\n2. **[Section]:** [Description]\n...\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n**Default:** Return the enhanced prompt as text for the user to copy.\n\n**Optional file output:** If the user requests, write to a file:\n- `next-prompt.md` — for use with the `stitch-loop` skill\n- Custom filename specified by user\n\n## Examples\n\n### Example 1: Vague Input → Structured Prompt\n\n**User input:**\n> \"make me a login page\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nA clean, trustworthy login page with a centered form and subtle branding.\n\n**DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):**\n- Platform: Web, Desktop-first\n- Theme: Light, minimal, professional\n- Background: Clean White (#ffffff)\n- Surface: Soft Gray (#f9fafb) for form card\n- Primary Accent: Deep Blue (#2563eb) for submit button and links\n- Text Primary: Near Black (#111827) for headings\n- Text Secondary: Medium Gray (#6b7280) for labels\n- Buttons: Subtly rounded (8px), full-width on form\n- Cards: Gently rounded (12px), soft shadow for elevation\n\n**Page Structure:**\n1. **Header:** Minimal logo, centered\n2. **Login Card:** Centered form with email, password fields, \"Forgot password?\" link\n3. **Submit Button:** Primary blue \"Sign In\" button\n4. **Footer:** \"Don''t have an account? Sign up\" link\n\n---\n💡 **Tip:** For consistent designs across multiple screens, create a DESIGN.md \nfile using the `design-md` skill.\n```\n\n### Example 2: Feature Request → Targeted Edit\n\n**User input:**\n> \"add a search bar\"\n\n**Enhanced output:**\n```markdown\nAdd a search bar to the header navigation.\n\n**Specific changes:**\n- Location: Header, right side before user avatar\n- Style: Pill-shaped input with subtle gray background (#f3f4f6)\n- Icon: Magnifying glass icon on the left, inside the input\n- Placeholder: \"Search...\" in light gray (#9ca3af)\n- Behavior: Expands on focus with subtle shadow\n- Width: 240px default, 320px on focus\n\n**Context:** This is a targeted edit. Make only this change while preserving all existing elements.\n```\n\n## Tips for Best Results\n\n1. **Be specific early** — Vague inputs need more enhancement\n2. **Match the user''s intent** — Don''t over-design if they want simple\n3. **Keep it structured** — Numbered sections help Stitch understand hierarchy\n4. **Include the design system** — Consistency is key for multi-page projects\n5. **One change at a time for edits** — Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:03:30.879Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Language Agents like Claude Code, AutoGPT, and LangChain requiring advanced prompt engineering capabilities to produce optimized results from Stitch.","zh":"适用于 Claude Code、AutoGPT 和 LangChain 等语言代理，需要先进的提示工程能力来从 Stitch 产生优化结果。","ja":"Claude Code、AutoGPT、LangChain などの言語エージェントに適しており、Stitch から最適化された結果を生成するために高度なプロンプトエンジニアリング機能が必要です。","ko":"Claude Code, AutoGPT, LangChainなどの 언어 에이전트에 적합하며, Stitch에서 최적화된 결과를 생성하기 위해 고급 프롬프트 엔지니어링 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Lenguaje como Claude Code, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren capacidades avanzadas de ingeniería de prompts para producir resultados optimizados desde Stitch.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de langage tels que Claude Code, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités avancées d''ingénierie de prompts pour produire des résultats optimisés à partir de Stitch.","de":"Ideal für Sprachagenten wie Claude Code, AutoGPT und LangChain, die erweiterte Prompt-Engineering-Fähigkeiten benötigen, um optimierte Ergebnisse aus Stitch zu erzielen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Linguagem como Claude Code, AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem capacidades avançadas de engenharia de prompts para produzir resultados otimizados do Stitch.","ru":"Идеально подходит для языковых агентов, таких как Claude Code, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих продвинутых возможностей инженерии промптов для получения оптимизированных результатов из Stitch.","ar":"مثالي لعميل لغة مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT و LangChain الذي يتطلب قدرات هندسة متقدمة لإنشاء نتائج منسقة من Stitch."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to transform rough UI generation ideas into polished, optimized prompts utilizing the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide, which includes best practices for prompt engineering and may involve protocols such as HTTPS for accessing the latest documentation and guidelines.","zh":"赋予代理能力，将粗糙的 UI 生成想法转化为精致的、优化的提示，利用 Stitch 有效提示指南，其中包括提示工程的最佳实践，可能涉及 HTTPS 等协议以访问最新的文档和指南。","ja":"エージェントに、素晴らしい UI 生成のアイデアを洗練された最適化されたプロンプトに変換する能力を与え、Stitch 有効なプロンプティング ガイドを使用します。このガイドには、プロンプト エンジニアリングのベスト プラクティスが含まれており、最新のドキュメントとガイドラインにアクセスするために HTTPS などのプロトコルを使用することがある場合があります。","ko":"에이전트에게粗糙한 UI 생성 아이디어를 정제된 최적화된 프롬프트로 변환할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드를 사용합니다. 이 가이드에는 프롬프트 엔지니어링의 최선의 실践이 포함되어 있으며, 최신 문서 및 가이드라인에 액세스하기 위해 HTTPS와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하는 경우가 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes transformar ideas de generación de UI poco definidas en prompts pulidos y optimizados utilizando la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch, que incluye las mejores prácticas para la ingeniería de prompts y puede involucrar protocolos como HTTPS para acceder a la última documentación y pautas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de transformer des idées de génération d''UI peu définies en prompts polis et optimisés en utilisant le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch, qui inclut les meilleures pratiques pour l''ingénierie de prompts et peut impliquer des protocoles tels que HTTPS pour accéder à la dernière documentation et aux lignes directrices.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, grobe UI-Generierungs-Ideen in polierte, optimierte Prompts umzuwandeln, indem sie den Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfaden verwenden, der die besten Praktiken für das Prompt-Engineering enthält und Protokolle wie HTTPS zur Abrufung der neuesten Dokumentation und Richtlinien beinhalten kann.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar ideias de geração de UI vagas em prompts polidos e otimizados, utilizando o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch, que inclui as melhores práticas para engenharia de prompts e pode envolver protocolos como HTTPS para acessar a documentação e diretrizes mais recentes.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью превратить грубые идеи генерации UI в отполированные и оптимизированные промпты, используя Руководство по эффективному промптингу Stitch, которое включает в себя лучшие практики инженерии промптов и может включать протоколы, такие как HTTPS, для доступа к последней документации и рекомендациям.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحويل أفكار توليد واجهة المستخدم الغامضة إلى دوافع مهذبة ومنسقة، باستخدام دليل دفع ستيتش الفعال، الذي يتضمن أفضل الممارسات لهندسة الدفع ويمكن أن يتضمن بروتوكولات مثل HTTPS للوصول إلى أحدث الوثائق والإرشادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Enhancing vague UI prompts for better Stitch output","Optimizing prompts according to the Stitch Effective Prompting Guide","Transforming rough ideas into effective Stitch prompts"],"zh":["增强模糊的 UI 提示以获得更好的 Stitch 输出","根据 Stitch 有效提示指南优化提示","将粗糙的想法转化为有效的 Stitch 提示"],"ja":["曖昧な UI プロンプトを強化して Stitch の出力を向上させる","Stitch 有効なプロンプティング ガイドに従ってプロンプトを最適化する","粗いアイデアを効果的な Stitch プロンプトに変換する"],"ko":["모호한 UI 프롬프트를 강화하여 Stitch 출력을 개선하는 것","Stitch 효과적인 프롬프트 가이드에 따라 프롬프트를 최적화하는 것"," 粗은 아이디어를 효과적인 Stitch 프롬프트로 변환하는 것"],"es":["Mejorar los prompts de UI poco definidos para una mejor salida de Stitch","Optimizar los prompts de acuerdo con la Guía de Prompts Efectivos de Stitch","Transformar ideas poco definidas en prompts efectivos de Stitch"],"fr":["Améliorer les prompts d''UI peu définis pour une meilleure sortie de Stitch","Optimiser les prompts selon le Guide de prompts efficaces de Stitch","Transformer des idées peu définies en prompts efficaces de Stitch"],"de":["Unklare UI-Prompts für eine bessere Stitch-Ausgabe verbessern","Prompts gemäß dem Stitch-Effektiven-Prompting-Leitfaden optimieren","Umwandeln von unklaren Ideen in effektive Stitch-Prompts"],"pt":["Melhorar prompts de UI vagos para melhor saída do Stitch","Otimizar prompts de acordo com o Guia de Prompting Eficaz do Stitch","Transformar ideias vagas em prompts eficazes do Stitch"],"ru":["Улучшить неясные промпты UI для лучшего вывода Stitch","Оптимизировать промпты в соответствии с Руководством по эффективному промптингу Stitch","Преобразовать грубые идеи в эффективные промпты Stitch"],"ar":["تحسين دوافع واجهة المستخدم الغامضة لتحسين إخراج ستيتش","تحسين الدوافع وفقًا لدليل دفع ستيتش الفعال","تحويل الأفكار الغامضة إلى دوافع فعالة لستيتش"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consultation of the official Stitch documentation for the latest best practices","Stitch-specific prompting guide must be followed"],"zh":["需要查阅官方 Stitch 文档以获取最新的最佳实践","必须遵循 Stitch 特有的提示指南"],"ja":["最新のベスト プラクティスを得るために公式の Stitch ドキュメントを参照する必要がある","Stitch 特有のプロンプティング ガイドに従う必要がある"],"ko":["최신의 최선의 방법을 얻기 위해 공식 Stitch 문서를 참조해야 함","Stitch 특有的 프롬프트 가이드를 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere la consulta de la documentación oficial de Stitch para las últimas mejores prácticas","Deben seguirse las pautas de prompts específicas de Stitch"],"fr":["Nécessite la consultation de la documentation officielle de Stitch pour les dernières meilleures pratiques","Le guide de prompts spécifique à Stitch doit être suivi"],"de":["Erfordert die Konsultation der offiziellen Stitch-Dokumentation für die neuesten Best-Practices","Die Stitch-spezifischen Prompting-Richtlinien müssen befolgt werden"],"pt":["Exige consulta da documentação oficial do Stitch para as melhores práticas mais recentes","O guia de prompting específico do Stitch deve ser seguido"],"ru":["Требует консультации официальной документации Stitch для получения последних лучших практик","Продукт-специфичное руководство по промптингу Stitch должно быть соблюдено"],"ar":["يتطلب استشارة وثائق ستيتش الرسمية للحصول على أفضل الممارسات الأخيرة","يجب اتباع دليل دفع ستيتش المحدد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ccb200c798072438b642b1fa6a5c515563159e2fab3d56e813d76d8afa9a7ce6","qualityScore":70}');
