INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/agent-harness-construction', 'agent-harness-construction', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'official', 'agent-harness-construction affaan-m everything-claude-code official ai-agents anthropic claude claude-code developer-tools llm mcp productivity This skill helps developers design and optimize the core components of AI agents, including action spaces, tool definitions, and observation formatting. It is specifically aimed at improving agent performance on platforms like Anthropic''s Claude through MCP. 设计和优化AI代理的动作空间、工具定义和观察格式，以提高完成率 AIエージェントのアクションスペース、ツール定義、観測フォーマットを設計および最適化して完了率を向上させる AI 에이전트의 액션 공간, 도구 정의, 관찰 형식을 설계 및 최적화하여 완료率를 향상시킵니다 Agent Harness Construction es una habilidad para diseñar y optimizar AI agent action spaces, tool definitions y observation formatting para una mayor tasa de finalización. Agent Harness Construction est une compétence qui permet de concevoir et d''optimiser les espaces d''action, les définitions d''outils et la mise en forme des observations pour les agents IA pour une meilleure completion. Agent Harness Construction ist eine Fähigkeit zum Entwerfen und Optimieren von AI-Agenten-Aktionsräumen, Werkzeugdefinitionen und Beobachtungsformatierungen für eine höhere Fertigstellungsrate. Otimizar agentes de IA para alta taxa de conclusão envolve projetar espaços de ação de alta qualidade, definições de ferramentas explícitas e formatação de observações eficazes. Оптимизация ИИ агентов для повышения процентного коэффициента завершения включает в себя проектирование высококачественных пространств действий, явных определений инструментов и эффективного форматирования наблюдений. تحسين وحدات الإيضاح الذكية لتحقيق أعلى معدلات الإنجاز يتطلب تصميم مساحات العمل عالية الجودة وتحديد أدوات واضحة وتنسيق ملاحظات فعال how to use agent-harness-construction what is agent-harness-construction agent-harness-construction vs crewai agent-harness-construction alternative agent-harness-construction install agent-harness-construction setup guide optimize AI agent action space MCP tool definitions best practices improve Claude agent completion rate AI代理工具构建 AI代理最佳实践 动作空间设计 工具定义 观察格式 AI代理完成率优化 Designs stable, explicit tool names for agent action spaces Implements schema-first and narrow input definitions for tools Ensures deterministic output shapes from agent tools Optimizes agent context budget quality for efficient operation Improves agent recovery quality from errors during execution Avoids catch-all tools to maintain clear tool isolation agent-harness-construction is a developer skill for designing and optimizing AI agent action spaces, tool definitions, and observation formatting. It focuses on core constraints like action space quality and recovery quality to achieve higher completion rates for agents like Claude.');
