de Componentes Convex: Creación de ...","fr":"Guide d''Installation des Composants Convex: Création de C...","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Convex-Komponenten: Erstellung ...","pt":"Guia de Configuração de Componentes Convex","ru":"Настройка компонентов Convex: ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل إنشاء مكونات Convex"},"description":{"en":"Learn how to create self-contained Convex components with proper isolation and dependency management. Get started with Convex component authoring today!","zh":"Convex 组件编写指南，创建可重用、自包含的组件，实现依赖管理和导出","ja":"Convex コンポーネント著作のベストプラクティス，依存関係管理とエクスポートを実現","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트 작성 가이드，의존성 관리와导出機能을 갖춘 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트 생성","es":"Aprende a crear componentes Convex reutilizables con aislamiento, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias para compartir entre proyectos","fr":"Découvrez comment créer des composants Convex réutilisables avec isolation, exportations et gestion de dépendances pour les partager entre projets","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung für den Austausch zwischen Projekten erstellen","pt":"Aprenda a criar componentes Convex reutilizáveis com isolamento, exportação e gerenciamento de dependências adequados","ru":"Создавайте самодостаточные компоненты Convex с правильной изоляцией, экспортом и управлением зависимостями с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"ابني مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع العزل والتصدير وإدارة التبعيات المناسبة"},"definition":{"en":"convex-component-authoring is a technique for creating self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management.","zh":"Convex 组件编写是创建可重用、自包含的 Convex 组件的过程","ja":"Convex コンポーネント著作は、自己完結型の Convex コンポーネントを作成すること","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트 작성은 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성하는 과정","es":"Convex componente authoring es una técnica para crear componentes reutilizables con aislamiento y gestión de dependencias","fr":"L''authoring de composants Convex est une technique pour créer des composants réutilisables avec isolation et gestion de dépendances","de":"Convex-Komponentenauthoring ist eine Technik zur Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten mit Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","pt":"Convex component authoring é uma técnica para criar componentes reutilizáveis","ru":"Компоненты Convex - это техника создания самодостаточных компонентов","ar":"مكونات Convex هي تقنية لإنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام"},"features":{"en":["Creates self-contained Convex components with proper isolation","Supports exports and dependency management for sharing across projects","Follows documentation guidelines from https://docs.convex.dev/components","Utilizes component authoring guidelines from https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","Integrates with broader context from https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt"],"zh":["创建自包含、可重用的 Convex 组件","实现依赖管理和导出功能","支持 Convex 组件著作的文档和指南","使用 Convex CLI 进行组件管理","支持多种编程语言，包括 JavaScript 和 Python"],"ja":["自己完結型の Convex コンポーネントを作成","依存関係管理とエクスポート機能を実現","Convex コンポーネント著作のドキュメントとガイドをサポート","Convex CLI を使用してコンポーネントを管理","複数のプログラミング言語，包括 JavaScript と Python をサポート"],"ko":["재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트를 생성","의존성 관리와导出機能을 구현","Convex 컴포넌트 작성의 문서와 가이드를 지원","Convex CLI를 사용하여 컴포넌트를 관리","다수의 프로그래밍 언어，包括 JavaScript と Python을 지원"],"es":["Creación de componentes reutilizables","Aislamiento de componentes","Gestión de dependencias","Exportaciones de componentes","Integración con la documentación de Convex","Compatibilidad con múltiples proyectos"],"fr":["Création de composants réutilisables","Isolation de composants","Gestion de dépendances","Exportations de composants","Intégration avec la documentation de Convex","Compatibilité avec plusieurs projets"],"de":["Erstellung von wiederverwendbaren Komponenten","Isolation von Komponenten","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Exporten von Komponenten","Integration mit der Convex-Dokumentation","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Projekten"],"pt":["Criação de componentes reutilizáveis","Isolamento adequado","Exportação de componentes","Gerenciamento de dependências","Integração com Convex CLI","Documentação em https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"ru":["Создание самодостаточных компонентов","Правильная изоляция","Экспорт компонентов","Управление зависимостями","Интеграция с Convex CLI","Документация на https://docs.convex.dev/components"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","عزل مناسب","تصدير مكونات","إدارة التبعيات","التكامل مع Convex CLI","التعليمات على https://docs.convex.dev/components"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use convex-component-authoring","convex-component-authoring setup guide","convex-component-authoring vs component-based architecture","convex-component-authoring install","what is convex-component-authoring","convex-component-authoring alternative","convex-component-authoring documentation","convex-component-authoring tutorial","convex-component-authoring best practices"],"zh":["Convex 组件编写","AIエージェント开发","Convex CLI","JavaScript","Python","组件管理","依赖管理","导出功能"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント著作","AIエージェント","Convex CLI","JavaScript","Python","コンポーネント管理","依存関係管理","エクスポート機能"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트 작성","AI 도구 개발","Convex CLI","JavaScript","Python","컴포넌트 관리","의존성 관리","导出機能"],"es":["convex componente authoring","componentes reutilizables","aislamiento de componentes","gestión de dependencias","exportaciones de componentes","documentación de Convex","herramientas de AI","desarrollo de software","integración de componentes"],"fr":["authoring de composants Convex","composants réutilisables","isolation de composants","gestion de dépendances","exportations de composants","documentation de Convex","outils d''IA","développement de logiciels","intégration de composants"],"de":["Convex-Komponentenauthoring","wiederverwendbare Komponenten","Isolation von Komponenten","Abhängigkeitsverwaltung","Exporten von Komponenten","Convex-Dokumentation","KI-Tools","Softwareentwicklung","Komponentenintegration"],"pt":["convex component authoring","componentes reutilizáveis","isolamento de componentes","exportação de componentes","gerenciamento de dependências","convex cli","documentação convex"],"ru":["convex component authoring","самодостаточные компоненты","изоляция компонентов","экспорт компонентов","управление зависимостями","convex cli","документация convex","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["convex component authoring","مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","عزل مكونات","تصدير مكونات","إدارة التبعيات","convex cli","توثيق convex","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"benfwalla","repo":"things-to-be-happy-about","repoPath":"benfwalla/things-to-be-happy-about","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-07T01:49:01.489Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:58:21.109Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing reusable Convex components with proper isolation and dependency management.","zh":"非常适合需要可重用 Convex 组件的全栈代理，具有适当的隔离和依赖管理。","ja":"再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントを必要とするフルスタックエージェントに最適で、適切な隔離と依存関係管理を備えています。","ko":"재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소를 필요로 하는 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합하며, 적절한 격리 및 종속성 관리를 제공합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Full Stack que necesitan componentes Convex reutilizables con aislamiento y gestión de dependencias adecuados.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de composants Convex réutilisables avec une isolation et une gestion des dépendances appropriées.","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de componentes Convex reutilizáveis com isolamento adequado e gerenciamento de dependências.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым необходимы многократно используемые компоненты Convex с правильной изоляцией и управлением зависимостями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع العزل الصحيح وإدارة التبعيات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained Convex components with features like exports and dependency management, utilizing the Convex documentation and component authoring guidelines, and following best practices outlined in https://docs.convex.dev/components and https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含的 Convex 组件的能力，具有导出和依赖管理等功能，利用 Convex 文档和组件编写指南，并遵循 https://docs.convex.dev/components 和 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring 中概述的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが Convex ドキュメントとコンポーネントのオーサリング ガイドラインを利用し、https://docs.convex.dev/components および https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring に概説されているベスト プラクティスに従って、エクスポートや依存関係管理などの機能を備えたセルフ コンテンド Convex コンポーネントを作成できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 Convex 문서와 구성 요소 작성 가이드라인을 사용하여 https://docs.convex.dev/components 및 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring에 설명된 최선의 실践을 따르면서, 내보내기 및 종속성 관리와 같은 기능을 가진 자체 포함 Convex 구성 요소를 만들 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos con características como exportaciones y gestión de dependencias, utilizando la documentación de Convex y las directrices de autoría de componentes, y siguiendo las mejores prácticas descritas en https://docs.convex.dev/components y https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus avec des fonctionnalités comme des exportations et une gestion des dépendances, en utilisant la documentation Convex et les directives d''authoring de composants, et en suivant les meilleures pratiques décrites dans https://docs.convex.dev/components et https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, selbstenthaltene Convex-Komponenten mit Funktionen wie Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem sie die Convex-Dokumentation und die Richtlinien für die Erstellung von Komponenten verwenden und den in https://docs.convex.dev/components und https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring beschriebenen Best Practices folgen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autocontidos com recursos como exports e gerenciamento de dependências, utilizando a documentação Convex e as diretrizes de autorização de componentes, e seguindo as melhores práticas descritas em https://docs.convex.dev/components e https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные компоненты Convex с функциями, такими как экспорт и управление зависимостями, используя документацию Convex и руководство по созданию компонентов, а также следуя рекомендациям, изложенным в https://docs.convex.dev/components и https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات Convex محتوية على نفسها مع ميزات مثل الصادرات وإدارة التبعيات، باستخدام توثيق Convex وإرشادات تأليف المكونات، واتباع أفضل الممارسات الموجودة في https://docs.convex.dev/components و https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring."},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for sharing across projects","Implementing proper isolation and exports for Convex components","Managing dependencies for Convex components across multiple projects"],"zh":["为跨项目共享编写可重用 Convex 组件","为 Convex 组件实现适当的隔离和导出","跨多个项目管理 Convex 组件的依赖"],"ja":["プロジェクト間で共有可能な再利用可能な Convex コンポーネントを作成する","Convex コンポーネントの適切な隔離とエクスポートを実装する","複数のプロジェクト間で Convex コンポーネントの依存関係を管理する"],"ko":["프로젝트 간에 공유할 수 있는 재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소를 작성하는 것","Convex 구성 요소에 대한 적절한 격리 및 내보내기를 구현하는 것","여러 프로젝트 간에 Convex 구성 요소의 종속성을 관리하는 것"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para compartir entre proyectos","Implementación de un aislamiento y exportaciones adecuados para componentes Convex","Gestión de dependencias para componentes Convex en múltiples proyectos"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour partager entre les projets","Mise en œuvre d''une isolation et d''exportations appropriées pour les composants Convex","Gestion des dépendances pour les composants Convex sur plusieurs projets"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten zur Weitergabe zwischen Projekten","Implementierung einer ordnungsgemäßen Isolation und Exporte für Convex-Komponenten","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten für Convex-Komponenten in mehreren Projekten"],"pt":["Criar componentes Convex reutilizáveis para compartilhamento entre projetos","Implementar isolamento e exports adequados para componentes Convex","Gerenciar dependências para componentes Convex em vários projetos"],"ru":["Создание многократно используемых компонентов Convex для обмена между проектами","Реализация правильной изоляции и экспорта для компонентов Convex","Управление зависимостями для компонентов Convex в нескольких проектах"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمشاركتها عبر المشاريع","تطبيق العزل والصادرات المناسبة للمكونات Convex","إدارة التبعيات للمكونات Convex عبر مشاريع متعددة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Convex and its component authoring guidelines","Dependent on the Convex documentation and component authoring tools"],"zh":["需要了解 Convex 及其组件编写指南","依赖于 Convex 文档和组件编写工具"],"ja":["Convex とそのコンポーネントのオーサリング ガイドラインの知識が必要","Convex ドキュメントとコンポーネントのオーサリング ツールに依存している"],"ko":["Convex 및 구성 요소 작성 가이드라인에 대한 지식이 필요함","Convex 문서 및 구성 요소 작성 도구에 의존함"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de Convex y sus directrices de autoría de componentes","Dependiente de la documentación de Convex y las herramientas de autoría de componentes"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de Convex et de ses directives d''authoring de composants","Dépend de la documentation Convex et des outils d''authoring de composants"],"de":["Erfordert Kenntnisse von Convex und seinen Richtlinien für die Erstellung von Komponenten","Hängt von der Convex-Dokumentation und den Werkzeugen für die Erstellung von Komponenten ab"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento de Convex e suas diretrizes de autorização de componentes","Depende da documentação Convex e das ferramentas de autorização de componentes"],"ru":["Требует знания Convex и его руководства по созданию компонентов","Зависит от документации Convex и инструментов создания компонентов"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة Convex وإرشادات تأليف مكوناته","يعتمد على توثيق Convex وأدوات تأليف المكونات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"561346aded0969635fc3f32ae6d465f882266b6be20b4038c7a55645ff6db7c2","qualityScore":70}');
