INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('gustavscirulis/snapgrid/monetization', 'monetization', 'gustavscirulis', 'snapgrid', 'community', 'monetization gustavscirulis snapgrid community The monetization skill provides end-to-end guidance for Apple platform apps, helping developers determine pricing and choose between freemium, subscription, or one-time purchase models. monetization是指应用程序通过各种方式实现盈利的过程，包括订阅、一次性购买和免费增值模式 monetizationは、アプリケーションがさまざまな方法で収益を上げるプロセスです。サブスクリプション、ワンタイムパーチェージ、フリーミアムモデルなどが含まれます monetization은 애플리케이션이 다양한 방식으로 수익을 창출하는 과정으로, 구독, 일회성 구매, 무료增值 모델 등이 포함됩니다 La monetización es un proceso crucial para los desarrolladores de aplicaciones. Nuestra guía ofrece orientación sobre cómo elegir el modelo de monetización adecuado y cómo implementarlo de manera efectiva. La monétisation est un processus crucial pour les développeurs d''applications. Notre guide offre des conseils sur la façon de choisir le modèle de monétisation approprié et de le mettre en œuvre de manière efficace. Die Monetarisierung ist ein entscheidender Prozess für Anwendungsentwickler. Unser Leitfaden bietet Anleitung dazu, wie man das richtige Monetarisierungsmodell auswählt und es effektiv implementiert. O SnapGrid oferece um guia de monetização completo para desenvolvedores, incluindo estratégias de preços e modelos de receita. SnapGrid предлагает полное руководство по монетизации для разработчиков, включая стратегии ценообразования и модели дохода для ИИ Агентов. يقدم SnapGrid دليل تمويز كامل للمطورين، بما في ذلك استراتيجيات التسعير ونماذج الإيرادات how to monetize an app monetization strategy for Apple platform freemium vs subscription models app pricing guidance monetization setup guide what is monetization in app development monetization alternatives for Apple apps monetization vs in-app purchases AIエージェント_monetization 应用monetization策略 价格策略和层级 免费试用计划 特定应用类型monetization 订阅模式 一次性购买 免费增值模式 Provides guidance on choosing between freemium, subscription, or one-time purchase models Offers pricing tier recommendations for Apple platform apps Helps plan monetization for specific app types, such as kids or therapy apps Assists with free trial strategy and implementation Supports end-to-end monetization guidance, from initial consideration to pricing page structure Monetization is the process of generating revenue from an app, including strategies for pricing, free trials, and subscription models.');
